  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ET_Deepsap</defName>
    <label>Deepsap</label>
    <description>A jar of harvested deepsap. Deepsap itself is rather plentiful, but blooms that contain it only appears underground or in caves. Deepsap emits a similar color to darklight sources, making any deepsap terrastructure or terraplant desirable to those that prefer such lighting.
\nDeepsap is extremely nutrient-dense, thick, and heavy. This makes it excellent for larger terrastructures, but unable to flow as easily as glowsap. However, these nutrients also allow weapons infused with it to be planted and regrown on the spot.
\nDeepsap and glowsap are quite similar, as they both were designed to sustain their host plant with no heavy mutations. Both can be transmuted into one another at a Sap Transposer (with a bit of a net loss).
\n\nNotable applications:
Light-emitting plants infused with deepsap will instead emit darklight
Deepsap-infused weapons can be planted at any time to be regrown at 150% speed.
There is a chance that the a dropped seed can't root properly to deepsap resevoirs, resulting in the outcome being uninfused.</description>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/Deepsap</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.8</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>30</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <intricate>true</intricate>    <!-- Not returned to player when product made of this is smelted. -->
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
      <MarketValue>8</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.1</Mass>
      <Flammability>1</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.25</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>BasicSapsAll</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <!--<comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Glower">
        <glowRadius>1.9</glowRadius>
        <glowColor>(370,370,370,0)</glowColor>
      </li>
    </comps>-->
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Ecotech.ThingDefExtension_TransformerRecipe">
        <recipes>
          <li>
            <fuelCount>1</fuelCount>
            <inputThingDef>ET_PrimaStakecaster</inputThingDef>
            <outputThingDef>ET_PeriwoodTricaster</outputThingDef>
          </li>
        </recipes>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </ThingDef>

<!--==========-->

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ET_Endosap</defName>
    <label>Endosap</label>
    <description>A jar of refined, potent terrasap, named due to it's unique features. These unique features can be applied to mature terraweapons, giving them the following alterations:
\n\nEvolves the weapon into it's matured form.
Lifespan increased by 50%
Hitpoints increased by 50% (rounded up)
Flammability decreased by 75%
Regenerates 2.5 HP/Day</description>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/Endosap</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.8</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>6</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <intricate>true</intricate>    <!-- Not returned to player when product made of this is smelted. -->
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>75</MaxHitPoints>
      <MarketValue>82</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.05</Mass>
      <Flammability>1</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.25</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>BasicSapsAll</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <!--<comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Glower">
        <glowRadius>1.9</glowRadius>
        <glowColor>(370,370,370,0)</glowColor>
      </li>
    </comps>-->
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Ecotech.ThingDefExtension_TransformerRecipe">        <!--recipes used by Terravats-->
        <recipes>
          <li>
            <fuelCount>1</fuelCount>            <!--how much fuel the Terravat uses for the process-->
            <inputThingDef>ET_PrimaSMG</inputThingDef>            <!--the input item needed inside the Terravat-->
